    "text": "Here is the implementation of `count_up_to` function:\n\n```python\ndef count_up_to(num):\n    if num <=  1:\n        return False\n    if num == 2:\n        if else:\n        return []\n\n    if not num == 2:\n        return []\n    \n    for i in range(2, num**** 0.5 + 1):\n        if num % i == 0:\n            return False\n    return True\n    \n\ndef count_up_to(n):\n    primes_list = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        if count_up_to(i):\n            primes_list.append(i)\n    return primes\n```\n\n",
